{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"needs_information\",\n  \"objectives\": {\n    \"primary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂在 52 周治疗期内对特发性肺纤维化（IPF）疾病进展的优效性，主要基于第 52 周 FVC 自基线绝对变化。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 标题说明研究目的是评价 AD-101 在 IPF 受试者中的疗效和安全性；主要终点为第 52 周 FVC 自基线绝对变化。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/1:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Title: A Phase 2, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled, Multicenter Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of AD-101 in Subjects with Idiopathic Pulmonary Fibrosis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Primary endpoint: absolute change from baseline in forced vital capacity (FVC) in mL at Week 52\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂对第 52 周 FVC 占预计值百分比变化的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 percent predicted FVC change 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂对 6 分钟步行距离变化的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 change in 6-minute walk distance 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂对无进展生存期（疾病进展或死亡）的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 progression-free survival (disease progression or death) 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂对圣乔治呼吸问卷（SGRQ）总分变化的影响。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评价 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 相较于安慰剂的安全性和耐受性。\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 标题包含 Safety；研究设定安全性随访至第 56 周。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/1:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Title: A Phase 2, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled, Multicenter Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of AD-101 in Subjects with Idiopathic Pulmonary Fibrosis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/10:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Safety follow-up: through Week 56, including a safety visit 4 weeks after the last dose\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"endpoint\": {\n    \"primary_endpoint\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 自基线绝对变化（mL）\",\n      \"basis\": \"source\",\n      \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 明确主要终点为第 52 周 FVC 绝对变化。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Primary endpoint: absolute change from baseline in forced vital capacity (FVC) in mL at Week 52\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"key_secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 占预计值百分比（percent predicted FVC）变化\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 percent predicted FVC change 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"6 分钟步行距离（6MWD）变化\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 change in 6-minute walk distance 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"无进展生存期（疾病进展或死亡）\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 progression-free survival (disease progression or death) 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"圣乔治呼吸问卷（SGRQ）总分变化\",\n        \"basis\": \"source\",\n        \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 将 change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score 列为关键次要终点。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\n            \"quote\": \"Key secondary endpoints: percent predicted FVC change; change in 6-minute walk distance; progression-free survival (disease progression or death); change in St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire total score\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"measurement_details\": \"FVC 以 mL 计，主要分析采用 MMRM；第 52 周为治疗期结束，末次给药后 4 周安全性随访至第 56 周。\",\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"肺功能测量是否采用标准化 spirometry 和中心化判读？第 52 周访视窗口及缺失数据规则是什么？\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"estimand\": {\n    \"treatment\": {\n      \"text\": \"AD-101 100 mg qd vs 安慰剂；AD-101 200 mg qd vs 安慰剂（分别估计）\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户明确设 3 个治疗组（AD-101 100 mg qd、AD-101 200 mg qd、安慰剂 qd），随机 1:1:1，双盲。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"population\": {\n      \"text\": \"经 HRCT 或肺活检确诊 IPF 的成人受试者；年龄≥40 岁，筛查时 FVC%pred≥50%，DLCO≥35%。\",\n      \"basis\": \"source\",\n      \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 入选标准给出年龄、诊断方式、FVC%pred 和 DLCO 阈值。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/8:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Key inclusion criteria: age 40 years or older; diagnosis of IPF confirmed by HRCT or lung biopsy; FVC percent predicted at screening of at least 50%; DLCO at least 35%\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"variable\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 自基线绝对变化（mL）\",\n      \"basis\": \"source\",\n      \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 主要终点。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/6:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Primary endpoint: absolute change from baseline in forced vital capacity (FVC) in mL at Week 52\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ice_strategy\": {\n      \"text\": \"对治疗中止采用治疗政策策略；对死亡或肺移植采用复合/最差等级策略并纳入主要分析；因耐受性减量按方案保留在随机治疗组。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"输入未明确 intercurrent events 处理策略；IPF 研究中死亡、肺移植、治疗中止和救援治疗会影响 FVC 变化估计，建议在 SAP 中预先规定。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"summary_measure\": {\n      \"text\": \"第 52 周 FVC 绝对变化的最小二乘均值组间差异（AD-101 各剂量 vs 安慰剂）\",\n      \"basis\": \"source\",\n      \"reason\": \"源 synopsis 说明主要终点采用 MMRM；MMRM 通常以 LS mean difference 作为组间效应汇总指标。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/11:p\",\n          \"quote\": \"Statistical analysis: the primary endpoint will be analyzed using a mixed model for repeated measures (MMRM)\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ice_events\": [\n      \"治疗中止\",\n      \"死亡\",\n      \"肺移植\",\n      \"急性加重\",\n      \"因 IPF 进展使用禁用/救援治疗\"\n    ],\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"治疗中止、死亡、肺移植、急性加重或使用禁用/救援治疗等 intercurrent events 应分别采用哪种策略（治疗政策、假想、复合、在治疗等）？\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"sample_size\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"主要终点为第 52 周 FVC 自基线绝对变化（mL），采用 MMRM 分析。\",\n      \"3 组按 1:1:1 随机，计划入组约 120 例，每组约 40 例。\",\n      \"α=0.05（双侧）；两个 AD-101 剂量组分别与安慰剂比较时需预先指定多重性控制策略；当前样本量估算按单个比较近似，未包含多重性校正。\",\n      \"Power=80%。\",\n      \"预期第 52 周 FVC 绝对变化组间差异（AD-101 vs 安慰剂）=170 mL。\",\n      \"共同标准差 SD=250 mL。\",\n      \"失访/主要终点缺失率=15%。\",\n      \"样本量估算用两样本 t 检验近似；MMRM 因利用重复测量可能提高效率。\"\n    ],\n    \"alpha\": \"0.05（双侧）；若两个剂量组均做确证性优效比较，需预先指定多重性控制以维持总体 I 类错误。\",\n    \"power\": \"80%\",\n    \"model\": \"MMRM（源 synopsis 指定主要终点采用 MMRM）；样本量估算可用两样本 t 检验近似校核。\",\n    \"planned_n\": \"约 120 例（每组约 40 例，1:1:1）\",\n    \"attrition\": \"15%\",\n    \"justification\": \"在 α=0.05（双侧）、每组约 34 例可评估（120 例计划入组、15% 失访）、第 52 周 FVC 绝对变化 SD=250 mL、组间差异 170 mL 的假设下，两样本 t 检验近似 power 约 80%。若真实组间差异为 100 mL，power 约 38%，提示 120 例更适合 II 期信号探索而非确证性检验。\",\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"用于样本量计算的预期 FVC 组间差异和共同标准差是否有申办方/文献依据？若无，是否接受推荐假设（差异 170 mL，SD 250 mL）？\",\n      \"两个 AD-101 剂量组与安慰剂比较时采用何种多重性控制策略（如固定序列、Hochberg、图形法）？\"\n    ],\n    \"references\": [\n      {\n        \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n        \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/5:p\",\n        \"quote\": \"Planned enrollment: approximately 120 subjects, randomized 1:1:1\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-1d94b17627800e2adaa15f0c3d73843f3d36ba429fc8f115b80d171fb866f4d0\",\n        \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/11:p\",\n        \"quote\": \"Statistical analysis: the primary endpoint will be analyzed using a mixed model for repeated measures (MMRM)\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"interim_planning\": null,\n  \"non_inferiority_margin\": null,\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"是否计划进行期中分析？如计划，请提供时点（周或受试者数）、信息分数、目的（无效性/优效性/安全性）、决策规则、负责决策的委员会及对最终分析 I 类错误的影响。\",\n    \"肺功能测量是否采用标准化 spirometry 和中心化判读？第 52 周访视窗口及缺失数据规则是什么？\",\n    \"治疗中止、死亡、肺移植、急性加重或使用禁用/救援治疗等 intercurrent events 应分别采用哪种策略（治疗政策、假想、复合、在治疗等）？\",\n    \"用于样本量计算的预期 FVC 组间差异和共同标准差是否有申办方/文献依据？若无，是否接受推荐假设（差异 170 mL，SD 250 mL）？\",\n    \"两个 AD-101 剂量组与安慰剂比较时采用何种多重性控制策略（如固定序列、Hochberg、图形法）？\"\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_questions\": [\n    \"是否计划进行期中分析？如计划，请提供时点（周或受试者数）、信息分数、目的（无效性/优效性/安全性）、决策规则、负责决策的委员会及对最终分析 I 类错误的影响。\",\n    \"肺功能测量是否采用标准化 spirometry 和中心化判读？第 52 周访视窗口及缺失数据规则是什么？\",\n    \"治疗中止、死亡、肺移植、急性加重或使用禁用/救援治疗等 intercurrent events 应分别采用哪种策略（治疗政策、假想、复合、在治疗等）？\",\n    \"用于样本量计算的预期 FVC 组间差异和共同标准差是否有申办方/文献依据？若无，是否接受推荐假设（差异 170 mL，SD 250 mL）？\",\n    \"两个 AD-101 剂量组与安慰剂比较时采用何种多重性控制策略（如固定序列、Hochberg、图形法）？\"\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"design-elements.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"design-elements-intake","sha256":"386daf7697c68e354ab118ddcbea4e929a1034e95f7fd83cc8e6e7b1a6af7446"}],"logical_call_id":"call:design-elements:ba66e069c211ef09f367f0ff4f0de2b105446b5e744dabeab205250f20718a13:design-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:design-elements:ba66e069c211ef09f367f0ff4f0de2b105446b5e744dabeab205250f20718a13:design-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/design-